# Code of Conduct

## Our pledge

We want participation in **{{ project_name }}** to be a harassment-free experience for everyone.
We welcome contributors of all backgrounds and identities.

## Expected behavior

- Be respectful and constructive.
- Assume good intent and communicate with empathy.
- Focus on what’s best for the community.

## Unacceptable behavior

- Harassment, discrimination, or hateful conduct.
- Personal attacks, threats, or intimidation.
- Unwelcome sexual attention or deliberate disruption.

## Reporting

If you experience or witness unacceptable behavior, please report it:

- Email: {{ author_email }}

Reports will be handled as privately as possible.

## Enforcement

Project maintainers may take any action they deem appropriate, including warning or banning participants from project spaces.
